# Project Direction

- Read `MANIFEST.md` before making architecture-shaping decisions.
- Treat PETS as a long-lived project, not a throwaway static page dump.
- Keep the product AI-first and human-in-the-loop.
- Preserve the distinction between current `pywebview` runtime and future desktop-shell direction.
- Do not treat saved-page artifacts as project truth.
